CAS number: 007440-36-0; 
Formula: Sb; 
UUID: 4f672a15-32e0-3f14-bda0-b4ca9f0a80ac
Smelting of concentrate and disposal of wastes.
Location: The model represents Antimony production in China. China produces more than 80% of the global Antimony.
Technology: The data represent a mixture of blast furnace, rotry kiln and electrowinning process. It is approximated from lead smelting
Time period: undefined
Production volume: na
Sampling: literature 
Extrapolations: see Geography and Technology
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_4f672a15-32e0-3f14-bda0-b4ca9f0a80ac.xml</text>
